  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "UML class diagram of the two licensing profiles. Simple Licensing: the abstract AnyLicenseInfo specialises Core/Element; LicenseExpression (customIdToUri, licenseExpression string[1], licenseListVersion SemVer) specialises it, and SimpleLicensingText (licenseText[1]) specialises Element directly. Expanded Licensing: ConjunctiveLicenseSet and DisjunctiveLicenseSet (each with members), IndividualLicensingInfo, WithAdditionOperator (subjectExtendableLicense, subjectAddition) and the abstract ExtendableLicense all specialise AnyLicenseInfo. ExtendableLicense is specialised by the abstract License (licenseText, isDeprecatedLicenseId, isFsfLibre, isOsiApproved, licenseXml, obsoletedBy, seeAlso, standardLicenseHeader, standardLicenseTemplate), with subclasses ListedLicense (deprecatedVersion, listVersionAdded) and CustomLicense, and by OrLaterOperator (subjectLicense). LicenseAddition (additionText[1], …) specialises Element, with subclasses ListedLicenseException and CustomLicenseAddition.",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01VfkKocGaQW7Msro2t5S66U"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-10-03",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Diagramme de classes UML des deux profils de licence. Simple Licensing : la classe abstraite AnyLicenseInfo spécialise Core/Element ; LicenseExpression (customIdToUri, licenseExpression string[1], licenseListVersion SemVer) la spécialise, et SimpleLicensingText (licenseText[1]) spécialise directement Element. Expanded Licensing : ConjunctiveLicenseSet et DisjunctiveLicenseSet (chacune avec members), IndividualLicensingInfo, WithAdditionOperator (subjectExtendableLicense, subjectAddition) et la classe abstraite ExtendableLicense spécialisent toutes AnyLicenseInfo. ExtendableLicense est spécialisée par la classe abstraite License (licenseText, isDeprecatedLicenseId, isFsfLibre, isOsiApproved, licenseXml, obsoletedBy, seeAlso, standardLicenseHeader, standardLicenseTemplate), avec les sous-classes ListedLicense (deprecatedVersion, listVersionAdded) et CustomLicense, et par OrLaterOperator (subjectLicense). LicenseAddition (additionText[1], …) spécialise Element, avec les sous-classes ListedLicenseException et CustomLicenseAddition.",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
