        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01TkFVzHu3LN6P5Nj2psquPU"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-10-24",
      "lang": "fr"
    },
    {
      "text": "Diagrama de clases UML de los dos perfiles de licencias. Simple Licensing: la clase abstracta AnyLicenseInfo especializa Core/Element; LicenseExpression (customIdToUri, licenseExpression string[1], licenseListVersion SemVer) la especializa, y SimpleLicensingText (licenseText[1]) especializa Element directamente. Expanded Licensing: ConjunctiveLicenseSet y DisjunctiveLicenseSet (cada una con members), IndividualLicensingInfo, WithAdditionOperator (subjectExtendableLicense, subjectAddition) y la clase abstracta ExtendableLicense especializan AnyLicenseInfo. ExtendableLicense la especializan la clase abstracta License (licenseText, isDeprecatedLicenseId, isFsfLibre, isOsiApproved, licenseXml, obsoletedBy, seeAlso, standardLicenseHeader, standardLicenseTemplate), con las subclases ListedLicense (deprecatedVersion, listVersionAdded) y CustomLicense, y OrLaterOperator (subjectLicense). LicenseAddition (additionText[1], …) especializa Element, con las subclases ListedLicenseException y CustomLicenseAddition.",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01TkFVzHu3LN6P5Nj2psquPU"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-10-24",
      "lang": "es"
    },
    {
      "text": "مخطط أصناف UML لملفَّي تعريف الترخيص. Simple Licensing: الصنف المجرّد AnyLicenseInfo يخصّص Core/Element؛ ويخصّصه LicenseExpression (customIdToUri، licenseExpression string[1]، licenseListVersion SemVer)، ويخصّص SimpleLicensingText (licenseText[1]) الصنفَ Element مباشرة. Expanded Licensing: يخصّص AnyLicenseInfo كلٌّ من ConjunctiveLicenseSet وDisjunctiveLicenseSet (لكلٍّ منهما members) وIndividualLicensingInfo وWithAdditionOperator (subjectExtendableLicense، subjectAddition) والصنف المجرّد ExtendableLicense. ويخصّص ExtendableLicense الصنفُ المجرّد License (licenseText، isDeprecatedLicenseId، isFsfLibre، isOsiApproved، licenseXml، obsoletedBy، seeAlso، standardLicenseHeader، standardLicenseTemplate) مع صنفيه الفرعيين ListedLicense (deprecatedVersion، listVersionAdded) وCustomLicense، وكذلك OrLaterOperator (subjectLicense). ويخصّص LicenseAddition (additionText[1]، …) الصنفَ Element، مع صنفيه الفرعيين ListedLicenseException وCustomLicenseAddition.",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01TkFVzHu3LN6P5Nj2psquPU"
